Cards
-----
Bootstrap’s cards provide a flexible and extensible content container with multiple variants and options.
class list:
  card, text-center, text-end, mb-3, w-25, w-50... (for main div)
  text-bg-dark,text-bg-primary (colors for main div)
	card-img-top, card-img-bottom, card-img   (for img)
	card-body, card-img-overlay (for sub div)
	  card-title (for heading)
	  card-text (for for p/div)
	  btn btn-primary (for a)	